#: ../../source/docs/building-a-blimp.rst:5 b99dc8796154401ca0d4dcad9d21ec06
msgid "Building a Blimp"
msgstr "搭建飞艇"

#: ../../source/docs/building-a-blimp.rst:8 4df996cf583f433b91f34e7cb162b63d
msgid "Building an Indoor finned Blimp"
msgstr "搭建室内拍翼飞艇"

#: ../../source/docs/building-a-blimp.rst:9 eb40db5db72e4ec2a19ff68683ed19e5
msgid ""
"This type of blimp has four flapping fins driven by servos, which combine to"
" provide X, Y, Z and Yaw control, while pendulum stability keeps roll and "
"pitch close to zero."
msgstr "这种飞艇有四片由舵机驱动的拍翼，组合起来提供 X、Y、Z 和偏航控制，而钟摆稳定性使横滚和俯仰接近零。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-a-blimp.rst:11 dd0b914264e0433197bcdeb032be69e3
msgid ""
"These instructions are specifically for building a ~50cm diameter spherical "
"blimp, although the sizes of parts can be adapted to build bigger blimps of "
"the same type. This size of balloon will give about 50g of lift (excluding "
"the lift required to lift the envelope itself)."
msgstr ""
"这些说明专门用于搭建直径约 50 cm 的球形飞艇，不过零件尺寸可以调整以搭建同类型更大的飞艇。这种气球大小可提供约 50g "
"升力（不包括起浮气囊本身所需的升力）。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-a-blimp.rst:14 a6da879123f84f8b8ed1a85d582f12f4
msgid "Parts"
msgstr "零件清单"

#: ../../source/docs/building-a-blimp.rst:16 ef7742470ab44dbb8ca7e512bb854b53
msgid ""
"Autopilot. This is the most complex part to find due to the very specific "
"limitations. Due to the very low weight limit, none of the usual high-end "
"autopilots are suitable, as they are much too heavy. The most suitable "
"autopilots are the single-pcb type, such as the Matek F405-STD, which has "
"had extensive testing with Blimp. It includes a microSD card slot and has "
"good rc input and pwm outputs, which make it highly convenient, especially "
"for development, but it still weighs 9 grams. Using a autopilot like this "
"one which is designed to be powered from 5v rather than battery power is "
"optimal, as autopilots that can be powered from battery usually require a "
"minimum of 2S or 3S voltage, and the only servos small enough for this "
"application can only run from 5v or less. There are some other autopilots "
"available which weigh closer to 2-3 grams which would allow for more "
"payload, although they generally have a dataflash chip instead of a microSD "
"card slot (among other things) which is less convenient. :ref:`This page "
"<common-autopilots>` gives some further information on what to consider in "
"an ArduPilot autopilot."
msgstr ""
"飞控。由于限制非常具体，这是最难选的部分。受限于极低的重量上限，常用的高端飞控都不适合，因为太重。最合适的是单 PCB 类型，例如 Matek "
"F405-STD，它已与 Blimp 进行过大量测试。它内置 microSD 卡槽，并有良好的 RC 输入与 PWM "
"输出，使用起来非常方便（尤其开发时），但仍重达 9 克。最优做法是使用这种设计为 5V 供电而非电池供电的飞控，因为可由电池直接供电的飞控通常需要至少 "
"2S 或 3S 电压，而本应用足够小的舵机一般只能由 5V 或更低电压驱动。还有一些重量约 2-3 克的飞控可使飞艇有更多载荷余量，但它们一般使用 "
"dataflash 芯片而非 microSD 卡槽（其他方面也有所简化），使用不便。:ref:`此页 <common-autopilots>` "
"给出了选择 ArduPilot 飞控时需要考虑的更多信息。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-a-blimp.rst:17 4bd4db0e28864f35bc46bc6d3f7d1609
msgid ""
"Envelope to be filled with helium. The ~50 cm spherical foil party balloons "
"work quite well for indoor use."
msgstr "用于充氦气的气囊。约 50 cm 的球形铝箔派对气球非常适合室内使用。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-a-blimp.rst:18 bc0e5a8752a0428c927943aadc2c4807
msgid "Four servos. The 1.7g micro servos are suggested."
msgstr "四个舵机。建议使用 1.7g 微型舵机。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-a-blimp.rst:19 44c869dbaf134a37a90708b2d27d729c
msgid ""
"Approx. 1-2mm thick sheets of balsa wood and plastic freezer bags for making"
" the fins."
msgstr "约 1-2mm 厚的轻木薄片和塑料冷冻袋，用于制作拍翼。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-a-blimp.rst:20 fd69b74a2bd94b069cf7408df1b92933
msgid "Very thin wires."
msgstr "非常细的导线。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-a-blimp.rst:21 74144c6a062c4fbb885ac0eb3081191d
msgid ""
"Battery. For this size of blimp, 150-300mAh 1S is generally most suitable."
msgstr "电池。对这个尺寸的飞艇，一般 150-300mAh 1S 最合适。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-a-blimp.rst:22 3170ddfe08664b4893b0d08387ad4b37
msgid ""
"Telemetry module. Unfortunately, the usual SiK telemetry modules are too "
"heavy for this case. The smallest versions of the ESP8266 modules, such as "
"the ESP-01 or ESP-07 are most suitable."
msgstr "数传模块。可惜常用的 SiK 数传模块在此场景下太重了。最小版本的 ESP8266 模块，例如 ESP-01 或 ESP-07 最合适。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-a-blimp.rst:23 8f41d914fca849babcdbf575a45693e4
msgid ""
"For RC control, again, finding a tiny RC receiver is necessary. The OrangeRx"
" Nano DSM2/DSMX receiver is a great option as it only weighs 0.5 grams."
msgstr ""
"RC 控制方面，同样需要找一个非常小的 RC 接收机。OrangeRx Nano DSM2/DSMX 接收机是不错的选择，因为它仅重 0.5 克。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-a-blimp.rst:24 327012be45d349ad93aaa74f0615775d
msgid ""
"A 5V Step-Up Voltage Regulator for powering the autopilot from 1S. In tests "
"it was found that the autopilot could be powered from the battery directly, "
"however it browned out at around 3.6v (i.e. rebooted repeatedly due to low "
"voltage) which means you would not be able to use the full battery capacity "
"if you do not use one of these."
msgstr ""
"一个 5V 升压稳压器，用于将 1S 电池升压给飞控供电。测试发现飞控可由电池直接供电，但在约 3.6V "
"时会进入欠压复位（即由于低电压反复重启），这意味着不使用升压模块时无法用完电池全部容量。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-a-blimp.rst:27 beba2510c6ed4e4b85b533bb16f2af7a
msgid "Wiring"
msgstr "接线"

#: ../../source/docs/building-a-blimp.rst:29 6d440b107d844386b0d571dd9c8bb5b6
msgid ""
"The 5v step-up converter is added to allow the autopilot to run from a 1S "
"battery. Its input comes from directly from the battery, and the output goes"
" to the autopilot's 5v pin."
msgstr "5V 升压模块用于让飞控从 1S 电池工作。它的输入直接来自电池，输出接到飞控的 5V 引脚。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-a-blimp.rst:31 c65ab5fe50d64a2492f4ce746459b65c
msgid ""
"If a MatekF405-STD autopilot is used, the RC receiver is powered from one of"
" the 4.5v pins on the autopilot. Otherwise, any 5v pin on the board can be "
"used. This is because the 4.5v pins are also powered when the autopilot is "
"powered via USB, thus allowing setup and RC calibration without a battery "
"connected. The receiver's output is connected to the RX2 input of the "
"autopilot."
msgstr ""
"若使用 MatekF405-STD 飞控，RC 接收机由飞控上某个 4.5V 引脚供电；否则可使用板上任意 5V 引脚。这是因为 4.5V "
"引脚在飞控通过 USB 供电时也带电，因此可在不接电池的情况下完成设置与 RC 校准。接收机的输出连接到飞控的 RX2 输入。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-a-blimp.rst:33 6995ba0b683f4c02aabdc572b3884e0e
msgid ""
"The Wi-Fi module is powered directly from the battery. Its TX and RX pins "
"are connected to the RX3 and TX3 pins on the autopilot."
msgstr "Wi-Fi 模块由电池直接供电。其 TX 与 RX 引脚连接到飞控的 RX3 与 TX3 引脚。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-a-blimp.rst:35 b109a812fcda4cc3b111ea2faebca9c2
msgid ""
"The four servos are connected to four of the servo/motor outputs on the "
"board, and are powered directly from the battery."
msgstr "四个舵机连接到板上四个舵机 / 电机输出，由电池直接供电。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-a-blimp.rst:38 4fc5121f73044cd7bfb5160f0899d093
msgid "Building the Fins"
msgstr "制作拍翼"

#: ../../source/docs/building-a-blimp.rst:40 fffdf7883d0343198d0c9c3b88455eb6
msgid ""
"Cut 8 strips from the sheet of balsa wood, measuring 185 mm by 5 mm. Make "
"sure to cut along the grain."
msgstr "从轻木板上裁出 8 根条，规格为 185mm × 5mm。请确保沿木纹方向裁切。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-a-blimp.rst:41 94a1f3595236413a97f59a1ce37bd0cb
msgid ""
"Use super glue to glue the ends of two strips at 90 degrees to each other, "
"forming a right-angled triangle."
msgstr "用强力胶将两根条的端部以 90 度粘在一起，形成一个直角三角形。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-a-blimp.rst:42 aa54e341558b4f6fa413d1ee20ef948b
msgid "Repeat this with the other 6 strips."
msgstr "其余 6 根条按同样方式制作。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-a-blimp.rst:43 90cafa88a9cb4658bab179a5edcaad1e
msgid "Cut triangles out of the plastic of the same size as the wood frames."
msgstr "从塑料片上裁出与木框同样大小的三角形。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-a-blimp.rst:44 207f3e07e038438e906be9f698275dde
msgid ""
"Glue the plastic to the the wood frames. The hypotenuse edge will be left "
"loose. Try to keep the plastic pulled flat while you glue, but without "
"warping the wood frame."
msgstr "将塑料粘到木框上。斜边一侧保持不粘以便活动。粘的时候尽量让塑料保持平整，但不要把木框弄变形。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-a-blimp.rst:45 e4ae9cc4621249fb90f9ce7017e5b4a1
msgid ""
"Glue the 90 deg attachment points to the corner of the triangle where you "
"glued the two strips together."
msgstr "在两根条粘在一起的直角处再粘上 90 度连接点。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-a-blimp.rst:47 6a209396dcd14a1e821425b57ba57e50
msgid "See the photo below for an example:"
msgstr "示例如下图所示："

#: ../../source/docs/building-a-blimp.rst:54 e924267239a944dcbfe435585d916bdd
msgid "Putting it all together"
msgstr "总装"

#: ../../source/docs/building-a-blimp.rst:56 8d72b70559894b90adf39f89abedb6d1
msgid ""
"The servos need to be attached in a specific orientation in order for the "
"flapping with offset to work correctly. These are as follows, orientation is"
" looking directly at the servo and balloon from 90 degrees:"
msgstr "舵机必须按特定方向安装，才能让带偏置的拍翼运动正确工作。具体方向如下（从舵机和气球正侧方 90 度观察）："

#: ../../source/docs/building-a-blimp.rst:59 85c8e3e5673e4a128063afdf34a68236
msgid ""
"The front and back servos are oriented sideways so that the fin will flap up"
" and down when the servo moves."
msgstr "前后两个舵机横向安装，使得舵机动作时拍翼上下拍动。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-a-blimp.rst:60 6fdcb7345fb24208a594611e3af7f079
msgid "Front servo: output gear at the top left of the servo body."
msgstr "前舵机：输出齿轮位于舵机本体左上角。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-a-blimp.rst:61 0777ba75bfc44ce6954534fd9ac334a0
msgid "Back servo: output gear at the top right of the servo body."
msgstr "后舵机：输出齿轮位于舵机本体右上角。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-a-blimp.rst:62 b1823f1559504509b5cb41b7168bc1eb
msgid ""
"The left and right servos are oriented upright so that the fin will flap "
"left to right when the servo moves."
msgstr "左右两个舵机竖直安装，使得舵机动作时拍翼左右拍动。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-a-blimp.rst:63 9918f8fba48240e2abd2f6975424b2df
msgid "Left servo: output gear at the top right of the servo body."
msgstr "左舵机：输出齿轮位于舵机本体右上角。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-a-blimp.rst:64 c64dbe2617fd4fcdbfb34bb40dcc8763
msgid "Right servo: output gear at the top left of the servo body."
msgstr "右舵机：输出齿轮位于舵机本体左上角。"

#: ../../source/docs/building-a-blimp.rst:66 72a52a13880147b799e92445a9d24d20
msgid "See the photos below for the orientation of each servo:"
msgstr "各舵机的方向参见下方照片："

#: ../../source/docs/building-a-blimp.rst:77 781d8e32ca424a898f88acecb1543b74
msgid "Back fin servo"
msgstr "后拍翼舵机"

#: ../../source/docs/building-a-blimp.rst:89 3957cb67de5544569a97521e5695690c
msgid "Front fin servo"
msgstr "前拍翼舵机"

#: ../../source/docs/building-a-blimp.rst:99 776283126dc244fab558417c315c7e37
msgid "Left fin servo"
msgstr "左拍翼舵机"

#: ../../source/docs/building-a-blimp.rst:111 bc085e1c34ac48978e7a259ffe9cd1ed
msgid "Right fin servo"
msgstr "右拍翼舵机"

#: ../../source/docs/building-a-blimp.rst:119 00f056a96ad14c2dabdfb0b7fdf758ce
msgid ""
"Now the servo horns can be glued onto the fins to allow for attaching to the"
" servos. Take care when gluing them so that there is enough clearance "
"between the fin and the servo's body to allow for its full range of motion. "
"With the fins and servos in the photos, it was best to glue the servo horns "
"such that when attached to the servo, the wood of the fin is on the side of "
"the servo where the output gear is closer to the edge."
msgstr ""
"现在可以把舵盘粘到拍翼上，用以连接到舵机。粘接时请注意，拍翼与舵机本体之间要留出足够空隙，以让舵机有完整的运动行程。对照片中这种拍翼与舵机的组合，最好的粘法是：当拍翼装到舵机上时，木质拍翼位于输出齿轮靠近边缘的一侧。"
